  Shake preview (elide)
  Estimated conversation: 280,000 → 180,000 tokens. Frees ~100,000 (36%).
  24 tool outputs and 8 text blocks. Recent ~4k tokens stay protected; removed text
  is recoverable.

  Idle: 45m since last response. Cache expiry is not observed.
  Request estimate: 300,000 → 200,000 (latest context minus reduction; overhead may
  differ).
  Codex: Astra has no >272k surcharge.
  Cold cache: next input ~33% cheaper.
  Warm cache, full invalidation: next input ~567% more; break-even by request ~18.
  Assumes standard rates, fixed sizes and subsequent cache hits.
  Configured compact budget: 290,000. Estimated headroom 0 → 90,000 tokens (model may
  compact earlier).
  Favor shake when it delays compaction, not simply before /compact.

  Conversation excludes instructions/tools. Costs exclude recovery and output; not plan-
  allowance predictions.


